    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d248">

                <pb facs="0379" n="309" xml:id="pg309"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Dayton.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 100.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-01-02"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 2, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> In bringing up arrears of correspondence,
                    it is a pleasant duty to acknowledge the receipt of your despatch, of the 25th
                    of November, No. 86, and to express to you the President’s satisfaction with
                    your proceeding in regard to the reply to Mr. Thouvenel’s confidential
                    conversation.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">William L. Dayton</hi>, Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
